3106.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-03T17:51:13Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- De-duplicates code for handling audio bus properties\r\n- Allows end users to expose their own audio bus properties with `@export_custom(PROPERTY_HINT_AUDIO_BUS, \"\") var bus : StringName = &\"Master\"`\r\n- Helps remove a core hack in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111455#discussion_r3912429750\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nTested briefly and it seems to work, but more testing would be welcome.\r\n\r\nA few things to note:\r\n\r\n- When inspecting a node with an audio bus property and editing audio buses at the same time, it won't automatically refresh the drop-down in the inspector until re-selecting the node. That's pretty much how most dynamic stuff works in Godot so I guess it's working as intended?\r\n- We can discuss what to do if a serialized bus name is no longer found. The current code keeps the old name as is and just selects nothing when opening the drop-down, so in case it gets re-added/renamed, nothing is lost. An alternative would be to force fallback to `Master`. On the getter side, there is already some logic to fall back to `Master` if the property points to a non-existing bus.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123106/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":9,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123106/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}